I awakened the Magic Censer. It is incredible; the tentacles are burning. The extracted substance is becoming an essence with a light aroma and drifting away like smoke. I feel great power coming from these embers.

The fighting is fierce; we are suffering many losses.

Now the Magic Censer is ablaze. The time has come. We must go. Let us put an end to this battle.
Take the Awakened Magic Censer with you.

[Challenge Objective]

Defeat the Resurrected Midranda in the Sanctuary of the Abyss.
When you are done, talk to Sage Celina in Pillai.
